      en: ["The building underwent significant expansion and modernization in the 1950s.", "It is situated near the Poto-Poto district, the cultural heart of the city.", "City Hall houses the official offices of the Mayor of Brazzaville.", "In 1960, the site was a focal point for national independence celebrations.", "The architectural style exhibits influences from French functionalism.", "National parades and public rallies are frequently held in the square out front."],
